<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell one points to 1,279.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell one points to 1,279.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo  shipping rates fell to 1,279 today from 1,280 on July 31, with the  base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following  sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
